     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: RequestGroup DDACTRegimenOrder</b></p><a name=\"DDACTRegimenOrder\"> </a><a name=\"hcDDACTRegimenOrder\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-anticancer-regimen-requestgroup.html\">Anti-Cancer Regimen RequestGroup</a></p></div><p><b>Request Category</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://snomed.info/sct 373846009}\">Adjuvant - intent</span></p><p><b>Request Category</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://hl7.org/fhir/us/codex-mopa/CodeSystem/treatment-line-cs 1L}\">First-line</span></p><p><b>instantiatesCanonical</b>: <a href=\"PlanDefinition-RegimenDdACT.html\">ddAC→T: Dose-Dense Doxorubicin/Cyclophosphamide then Paclitaxel — Breast Cancer</a></p><p><b>status</b>: Draft</p><p><b>intent</b>: Order</p><p><b>subject</b>: <a href=\"Patient-MOPAPatientExample.html\">Jane Smith (official) Female, DoB: 1968-04-15 ( http://hospital.example.org/patients#MRN-78432)</a></p><blockquote><p><b>action</b></p><blockquote><p><b>id</b></p>ac-phase-order</blockquote><p><b>title</b>: AC Phase (Cycles 1–4, q14d)</p><p><b>timing</b>: Count 4  times, Once per 14 days</p><blockquote><p><b>action</b></p><blockquote><p><b>id</b></p>doxorubicin-action</blockquote><p><b>title</b>: Doxorubicin 60 mg/m² IV day 1</p><p><b>timing</b>: Once per 14 days</p><p><b>resource</b>: <a href=\"MedicationRequest-DoxorubicinMedRequestDDACT.html\">MedicationRequest: status = draft; intent = order; medication[x] = doxorubicin</a></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>action</b></p><blockquote><p><b>id</b></p>cyclophosphamide-action</blockquote><p><b>title</b>: Cyclophosphamide 600 mg/m² IV day 1</p><p><b>timing</b>: Once per 14 days</p><p><b>resource</b>: <a href=\"MedicationRequest-CyclophosphamideMedRequestDDACT.html\">MedicationRequest: status = draft; intent = order; medication[x] = cyclophosphamide</a></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>action</b></p><blockquote><p><b>id</b></p>pegfilgrastim-action</blockquote><p><b>title</b>: Pegfilgrastim 6 mg subcutaneous day 2</p><p><b>timing</b>: Once per 14 days</p><p><b>resource</b>: <a href=\"MedicationRequest-PegfilgrastimMedRequestDDACT.html\">MedicationRequest: status = draft; intent = order; medication[x] = pegfilgrastim</a></p></blockquote></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>action</b></p><blockquote><p><b>id</b></p>t-phase-order</blockquote><p><b>title</b>: T Phase — Paclitaxel (Cycles 5–8, q14d)</p><h3>RelatedActions</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>ActionId</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td>ac-phase-order</td><td>After End</td></tr></table><p><b>timing</b>: Count 4  times, Once per 14 days</p><blockquote><p><b>action</b></p><blockquote><p><b>id</b></p>paclitaxel-t-action</blockquote><p><b>title</b>: Paclitaxel 175 mg/m² IV day 1</p><p><b>timing</b>: Once per 14 days</p><p><b>resource</b>: <a href=\"MedicationRequest-PaclitaxelMedRequestTPHase.html\">MedicationRequest: status = draft; intent = order; medication[x] = paclitaxel</a></p></blockquote></blockquote></div>"
